    "marginDamage": [],
    "formula": "# Fabled Lands: a roll above other's Defence wounds by difference.\n# Against several at once, each enemy attacks; you wound only the ones you attack.\nmine = 2d6 + me.combat + me.bonus\nfor enemy:\n  theirs = 2d6 + enemy.combat + enemy.bonus\n  if mine > enemy.defence and target: enemy.stamina -= mine - enemy.defence\n  if theirs > me.defence: me.stamina -= theirs - me.defence\nend"
  },
